---
import IconMapPin from '@components/IconMapPin.astro';
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';
import { BASES, BASE_THEMES } from '@lib/constants';
---

<section
    class="services-wellness-bases section section--dark"
    aria-labelledby="services-wellness-bases-title"
>
    <div
        class="glow services-wellness-bases__glow"
        aria-hidden="true"
    />
    <div class="shell services-wellness-bases__inner">
        <div class="services-wellness-bases__head">
            <SectionHead
                eyebrow="Retreat Bases"
                headingId="services-wellness-bases-title"
                isOnDark
            >
                {BASES.length}个康养疗愈基地，遍布山海之间
                <Fragment slot="text">
                    <p>惠泽布局了20多个各具特色的康养疗愈基地，有温泉、雨林、海滩、湿地等不同主题，为客户提供身、心、灵的疗愈体验。</p>
                </Fragment>
            </SectionHead>
            <ul
                class="services-wellness-bases__themes"
                data-scroll
            >
                {BASE_THEMES.map(theme => (
                    <li class="tag tag--on-dark">{theme}</li>
                ))}
            </ul>
        </div>

        <ul
            class="services-wellness-bases__grid"
            data-scroll="scale"
            data-scroll-stagger="0.06"
        >
            {BASES.map(base => (
                <li class="services-wellness-bases__item">
                    <span
                        class="services-wellness-bases__pin"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                        <IconMapPin size={13} strokeWidth={2} />
                    </span>
                    <span class="services-wellness-bases__text">
                        <span class="services-wellness-bases__name">{base.name}</span>
                        <span class="services-wellness-bases__region">{base.region}</span>
                    </span>
                </li>
            ))}
        </ul>

        <a
            class="link-more services-wellness-bases__link"
            data-scroll
            href="/network/bases"
        >
            查看全部康养基地
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-wellness-bases {
        overflow: clip;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__glow {
        left: -7.5rem;
        top: -8.75rem;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.875rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
        list-style: none;
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__head {
        margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, calc(1.58rem + 2.08vw), 3.25rem);
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__inner {
        position: relative;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__item {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--color-white-08);
        border: 0.0625rem solid var(--color-white-12);
        border-radius: var(--radius-card-sm);
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__link {
        color: var(--color-reef);
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__name {
        color: #FFFFFF;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__pin {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--color-white-12);
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: var(--color-reef);
        display: flex;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        height: 1.75rem;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 1.75rem;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__region {
        color: var(--color-white-70);
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.1875rem;
        min-width: 0;
    }

    .services-wellness-bases__themes {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
    }

</style>
